Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.00,0:06:33.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没人需要我这种人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我这种人已经没人要了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.01,0:06:39.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有人需要无法驾驶 EVA 的驾驶员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.87,0:06:43.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你在别人心中追寻自己呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}少啰嗦
