Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.83,0:07:20.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大家都是被称为绫波丽的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么每个都是我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.83,0:07:27.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为别人都叫我们绫波丽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.11,0:07:31.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你为什么拥有虚假的心和身体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是虚假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为我就是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.15,0:07:36.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.90,0:07:42.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是一个叫碇元渡的人类利用虚假的灵魂制造出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不过是像人类那般行事的虚假物体而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.22,0:07:51.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你看，你身体里有个黑暗、什么都看不见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.33,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么也不懂的心对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.33,0:07:57.27,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真正的你就在那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.17,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我就是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.12,0:08:05.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是由过往的时间，及跟他人的关联所造就的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.43,0:08:10.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}与他人的接触形成了现在的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.63,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人的接触和时间的流逝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.05,0:08:16.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}会渐渐改变我的心的形态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.45,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【那就是羁绊？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.80,0:08:18.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.03,0:08:22.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}它造就了至今为止被叫做绫波丽的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.53,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}它也将造就今后的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.79,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【那就是羁绊？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是真正的你不止一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.23,0:08:33.07,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只是，你不知道而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.58,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为不想看到，所以不自觉的逃避而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.76,0:08:38.85,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【因为害怕】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为自己或许不是人的模样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}迄今为止的我也可能会消失
