Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.02,0:08:50.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}害怕自己会消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}害怕自己会从大家的心中消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.15,0:08:55.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只属于自己的世界也会消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.45,0:09:01.54,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【害怕吧？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.27,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己会消失喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.50,0:09:04.54,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【害怕吧？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.13,0:09:07.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，我很高兴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.90,0:09:10.06,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为我想死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想要的是绝望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.80,0:09:13.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想回到虚无
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.06,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.04,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我无法回到虚无
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个人不让我回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.48,0:09:21.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还不愿让我回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.98,0:09:25.07,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为那个人需要，我才存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.81,0:09:26.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.47,0:09:28.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不再需要我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}被他抛弃了，我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我明明一直祈祷这一天……
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.34,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但，现在却很害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.74,0:09:43.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来，走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.74,0:09:48.19,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你就是为了今天，为了这一天而存在的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.08,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}丽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.95,0:09:50.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.46,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【然后——】
