Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.31,0:10:09.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己身体的形状好像渐渐消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.42,0:10:12.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好舒服…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.01,0:10:16.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好像自己扩展得好大好大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.49,0:10:18.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无边无际
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.96,0:10:19.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无边无际
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.78,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【这就是人类补完的起点】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.87,0:10:23.07,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【人类失去的东西】
