Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.62,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【填补那个心的空白】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.62,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【心和灵魂的补完即将开始】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.66,0:10:28.87,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【一切将回归虚无】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.04,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【人类的补完开始了】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.46,0:10:32.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}错了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:33.39,0:10:34.87,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}并不是重归于虚无
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.42,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只不过是让一切回归起点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.17,0:10:40.82,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}回到这个世界失去已久的母亲怀里而已
