Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.79,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}仅此而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.31,0:10:49.78,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就是补完计划
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.98,0:10:50.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.74,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们的心里永远都有空白的部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.07,0:10:55.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}丧失的部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.57,0:10:56.78,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【这就是心灵的饥饿的产生】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.40,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【这就是心灵的不安、恐惧的产生】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管是谁都会害怕心中的黑暗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一生都在试图逃避、消灭它
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.61,0:11:08.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可惜只要身为人类就不可能永远消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.79,0:11:09.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.82,0:11:13.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就要把人类的心合而为一让彼此互相填补
