Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太多管闲事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.75,0:11:18.78,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这根本是合谋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.63,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，你不也是希望这样的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.43,0:11:23.47,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【Case 1】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.12,0:11:24.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这里是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.80,0:11:27.26,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【葛城美里的情况　（Part 1）】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.05,0:11:31.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是美里心中的我的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是说，同时也是真嗣心中的我的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.41,0:11:40.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我为了找到我自己，必须跟各种各样的人接触
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.31,0:11:43.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}必须注视着我的内心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}必须注视着我心中的美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.69,0:11:49.37,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐有什么愿望呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.58,0:11:50.75,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【想当好孩子吗？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我必须当一个好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.21,0:11:54.17,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【为什么？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.49,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸都不在家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.85,0:11:58.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以要帮助妈妈，我必须当好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是我不想变成妈妈那样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.18,0:12:05.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸不在的时候妈妈总是哭泣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不可以哭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.64,0:12:07.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不可以撒娇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我一定要做好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要不被爸爸讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.16,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过我讨厌爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因此我讨厌好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.02,0:12:19.86,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.85,0:12:21.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我已经累了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管是维持自己的纯洁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是继续装纯洁的自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我已经累了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.41,0:12:31.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想被玷污
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想看看被玷污的自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以让那个男人拥抱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.79,0:12:38.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是喜欢他…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}才让他拥抱的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.18,0:12:43.59,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真的喜欢他吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.13,0:12:44.94,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对，没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.45,0:12:48.05,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他接受了真实的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.97,0:12:48.76,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【真的吗？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.23,0:12:50.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他很温柔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.01,0:13:03.72,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.42,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快停止！不要让真嗣看到这种场面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.19,0:13:10.27,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如今还有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然害羞啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.51,0:13:13.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么会觉得羞耻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.94,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在喜欢的男人面前你明明很自然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.15,0:13:19.25,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，应该说很乐意摆出这副模样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.94,0:13:20.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.54,0:13:21.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.00,0:13:26.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}给真嗣看到这个样子你明明很高兴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.14,0:13:27.53,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}胡说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.14,0:13:29.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.63,0:13:30.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.13,0:13:33.23,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你明明很想给父亲看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.85,0:13:34.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.20,0:13:38.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你在加持的睡脸上面寻求自己的平静
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.37,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.91,0:13:42.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在加持的温柔当中寻求自己的平静
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.11,0:13:43.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.42,0:13:47.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在加持的怀抱当中寻求父亲的影子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.07,0:13:49.01,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.28,0:13:51.94,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.95,0:13:53.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我在加持身上找到了自己的父亲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.01,0:14:00.18,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我逃走了，逃离他的身边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.88,0:14:02.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我很害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.89,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}简直就像跟爸爸在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是我其实很高兴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.14,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那成为一种快感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.06,0:14:13.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是心情好得不得了的瞬间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我不想那样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.12,0:14:17.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我跟他分手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.25,0:14:21.14,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也就是说恋爱的开始虽然没有理由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}结束却有理由的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.23,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你真温柔，加持
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}求求你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.43,0:14:29.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}用你的温柔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}玷污我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.76,0:14:38.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就算现在很讨厌自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也不该自我伤害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那只不过，是给自己刹那的惩罚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}用来敷衍自己罢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.88,0:14:47.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你最好别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.66,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那，你是叫我好好爱惜自己吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.63,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}男人都是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.29,0:14:58.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}然后就一头钻进工作或自己的世界里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.60,0:15:00.16,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}把我就这样丢在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.75,0:15:03.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}跟爸爸一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你只是一味地逃避痛苦的现实
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}痛苦的现实…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.27,0:15:10.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是在说我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.12,0:15:11.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}确实
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.11,0:15:14.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我就是这种人，没办法啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.46,0:15:17.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.64,0:15:18.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.26,0:15:21.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我常常对自己感到绝望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}觉得自己很恶心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.63,0:15:23.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不检点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.77,0:15:24.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是肮脏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:25.05,0:15:25.81,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}太难看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}下流
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}肮脏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没想到这就是成年人的交往，真让人恶心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.69,0:15:34.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}恭喜你晋升，葛城少校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.50,0:15:36.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大家所认同的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.20,0:15:39.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是为得到认同而演戏的那个我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.71,0:15:41.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是真正的自己啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.26,0:15:44.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真正的自己却一直在哭泣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.23,0:15:47.78,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，我是幸福的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.77,0:15:48.73,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【我是幸福的吗？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.07,0:15:50.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是幸福的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.90,0:15:51.90,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【我是幸福的吗？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.15,0:15:53.83,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是幸福的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.74,0:15:54.74,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【我是幸福的吗？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.52,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对，这并不是幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.49,0:15:58.45,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【幸福是什么？】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这不是真正的自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.47,0:16:03.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我只是这么深信罢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.77,0:16:06.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不这么做我们就活不下去吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.47,0:16:08.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没人在一起的话会感到害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}觉得不安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有人睡在身边的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你害怕一个人睡吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.28,0:16:17.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}果然还是一个人睡会寂寞吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她是忍受不了心里的失落感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以和谁都无所谓吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.15,0:16:23.96,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我只是想沉溺在简单的快乐当中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.11,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只是想用刹那间的逃避治疗内心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.23,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以我只是在利用男人而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.66,0:16:34.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不对
