Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.57,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.14,0:16:47.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是明日香心中的我的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.88,0:16:51.72,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也就是说，同时是真嗣心中的我的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.46,0:16:53.92,screen,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【{\fnEVA-FANS方正粗宋}惣{\r}流·明日香·兰利的情况 （Part 1）】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.62,0:16:56.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明日香在祈求什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.40,0:16:59.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我要一个人活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.61,0:17:00.81,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不需要爸爸和妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.12,0:17:02.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一个人活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.05,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我再也不会哭泣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.04,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，我还是在哭着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.89,0:17:10.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么哭呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不太会应付那孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这么没信心不像做医生的你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.25,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}医生也是人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.55,0:17:20.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}以前我就和你说过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.84,0:17:25.08,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是像你这样的女性怎会应付不了一个小孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.71,0:17:26.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她出奇地成熟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.45,0:17:29.71,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又一副拒人千里的态度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.64,0:17:31.81,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我常常觉得害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.74,0:17:34.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}老公你没有这种感觉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.84,0:17:39.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}反正你已经是明日香的母亲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.12,0:17:43.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但我首先是你的妻子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.03,0:17:45.21,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}同时发生的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.89,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对，从社会的角度来看确实如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.50,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}虽然你没办法不做那孩子的父亲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:52.01,0:17:55.31,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我却可随时不做她的母亲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.34,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}话是这么说没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要啊！妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.40,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要不做我的妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我会做个妈妈喜欢的好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.36,0:18:05.27,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以请不要不做我的妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.57,0:18:07.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以请看着我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.60,0:18:08.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要啊妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.39,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要杀我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.89,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你爸爸讨厌妈妈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:14.61,0:18:15.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要妈妈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.36,0:18:16.81,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一定是从一开始就不喜欢我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一定是从一开始就不想要我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以跟妈妈一起死吧
