Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.43,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我很碍事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.87,0:18:30.73,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要我了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.58,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}跟～我～一～起～死～吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.92,0:18:36.69,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要！我不是妈妈的洋娃娃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.31,0:18:39.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我要自己思考，自己活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.15,0:18:45.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那时候，妈妈吊在天花板上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.50,0:18:48.96,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}脸上看起来非常愉快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.92,0:18:53.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，我非常讨厌那个表情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.35,0:18:55.38,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌死亡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.72,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌自己的消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.53,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌男孩子
