Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌孤独
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.62,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌孤独
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.42,0:19:22.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌孤独——
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.63,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要不理我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.11,0:19:28.21,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要抛弃我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要杀我
