Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.36,0:19:40.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你父亲推动的人类补完计划
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.63,0:19:41.26,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.49,0:19:42.72,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这好像是其中一部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.34,0:19:46.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们也不知道真实
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只不过…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.90,0:19:51.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己此刻感受到的正是事实
