Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.96,0:20:08.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是其中之一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.90,0:20:10.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是你期望看到的结果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.59,0:20:12.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我期望的
